Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:02.14,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.36,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What's this? Did he wet himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.95,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,Prince Lyle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.95,0:00:09.86,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,I-I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.91,main,EGG,0,0,0,,But that looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:13.50,main,MAEBY,0,0,0,,Like you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:14.86,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,I told you I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.20,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.86,main,HAINA,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:24.23,main,STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Look, it's Prince Lyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.37,main,STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,He's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:30.58,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Mr. Lyle, please walk quietly in the hallway—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.38,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.92,main - italics,LYLE/I,0,0,0,,Every single one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:44.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Why did Prince Lyle stand in front of \Nus in such wild manner without trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:47.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,to hide his ferocious violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:51.01,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Don't say it like you encountered a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:53.13,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Probably to keep me in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:54.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,In check?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:58.55,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,He's the sixth prince,\N and I'm the ninth princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:02.54,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,In the royal hierarchy, I'm below him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:09.52,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,However, I'm engaged to you, \Nthe Hero's Scar and a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:12.49,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,So my status is rapidly rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:14.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:15.30,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:19.89,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,And now you've made\N your debut into society.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:24.30,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,From now on, our status will \Nbe above him in high society.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:26.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sounds complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:32.49,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,But with or without Father's order \Nand our status in high society,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:35.53,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I am happy to be betrothed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:37.29,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,As am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:42.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next time I meet with the king,\NI might kneel in gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:44.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Not that I'd ever do that to a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:46.29,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Well, you're supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:49.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,For now, I'd like to go \Napologize to Prince Lyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:51.42,main,MIRIKA/IXIO,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:30.16,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,GRADUATION, AND WHAT'S NEXT?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.51,0:03:29.73,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Today is your final exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I only need to go in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:33.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:39.33,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,For today's alteration, \Nlet's try changing the sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.33,0:03:40.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.91,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,This feels like an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:52.83,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Try touching other things \Nand expressing their sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, Miss Jenié.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:06.51,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,What are you working on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:08.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Collecting samples for alterations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:11.79,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Right. I don't get it, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:13.10,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:15.60,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon and Master Ixio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:19.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hello, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:22.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thinking about how today's my last \Nday to hear your voice at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:26.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It feels like the world is \Nfading into dusk out of sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:30.26,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,But school ends in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:32.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, then I'm not sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.25,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,These two really are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:42.88,main,KAST,0,0,0,,You will take the final exam \Nwith the other students.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This feels like an actual school!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:51.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But what a shame I'm no longer in a \Nspecial room with you, Professor Kast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:55.66,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I am watching you, even if we have many \Nother students, so best of luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:57.86,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,You two seem very close now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,We talked a lot during the exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:01.65,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,During the exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.89,0:05:03.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Like how she became a teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:07.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,following a man she was in love with \Nto the senior school for nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.90,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:14.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But he failed the test and only she \Nbecame a teacher. It's her second year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:17.42,main,KAST,0,0,0,,What the heck am I doing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:18.99,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:21.41,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,Why would she discuss that with a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:22.67,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,During the exam, no less?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.41,main,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:30.09,main,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Would you please introduce\Nyour fiancé to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:32.17,main,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Introduce him to us, Ixio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.17,0:05:34.20,main,FEMALE STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,How adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:35.81,main,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,He seems smarter than Ixio, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:39.74,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Mr. Kunon, please introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:46.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.\NMy name is Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:51.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm engaged to Princess Mirika Hughlia, \Nand I am Ixio Gurion's little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm actually relieved right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:06:01.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I was starting to wonder if Mirika \Nand my brother had no friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.85,0:06:03.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,because no one would\Napproach and talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:06.27,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,I'll let it slide, but don't \Ndisrespect Her Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.27,0:06:08.55,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Indeed! That was because...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:13.53,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I asked them to leave us alone, since \Nthis was a rare opportunity for me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:15.87,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,to enjoy my school life with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:18.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I appreciate your thoughtfulness, \NYour Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.77,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:25.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But it is true that I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:31.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It'd be rude to ask, "Don't you have \Nfriends?" or "Are you usually alone?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm glad that my brother isn't lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:39.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm really glad Your Highness has friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I didn't have to console you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:47.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,by reminding you of my situation and \Nsaying, "It's fine not to have friends."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.55,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:55.37,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,You totally {\i1}are{\i0} fine not \Nhaving friends, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:56.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:59.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Humans do surprisingly okay being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.07,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I knew you'd say that, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:12.82,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,Prince Lyle, it's time for the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:15.58,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Professors can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.61,main,EGG,0,0,0,,The final exam will be conducted all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:21.63,main,EGG,0,0,0,,I'm afraid even Your Highness \Nisn't allowed to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:24.21,main,MAEBY,0,0,0,,M-Maybe that's the case, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:33.31,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Everyone, please take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:35.66,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.81,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon, your seat is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:44.23,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Hey, Mirika!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.90,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Brother Lyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:55.82,main - flashback,MAID 1,0,0,0,,I hear he caused trouble at school again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:08:00.54,main - flashback,MAID 2,0,0,0,,Apparently, imperial studies couldn't \Nbe extended to the sixth prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.11,0:08:03.51,main - flashback,SERVANT,0,0,0,,He is still a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.51,0:08:05.86,main - flashback,SERVANT,0,0,0,,Try to be respectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:08.57,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Mr. Lyle, you need to—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:10.31,main - italics,LYLE/I,0,0,0,,Every single one of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:14.18,main - italics,LYLE/I,0,0,0,,They can't say anything to my face \Nbut talk behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:16.05,main - italics,LYLE/I,0,0,0,,They piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:19.22,main - italics,LYLE/I,0,0,0,,The people at the castle and at this school!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:20.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:24.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm Kunon Gurion, Princess Mirika's fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.56,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so happy to get\N a chance to say hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:35.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I didn't really get to the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:38.19,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,What are you?! What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:41.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Come on now, I'm your future brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.88,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Stop messing with me! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:44.11,main,HAINA,0,0,0,,His grip is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:45.87,main,EGG,0,0,0,,He's like a soft-shelled turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.87,0:08:47.61,main,EGG,0,0,0,,Though I've never seen one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:52.07,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,First of all, I never gave you \Npermission to speak or hold my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:54.28,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, what a manly voice you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:57.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I can tell from the feel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:09:00.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,that your face must also be manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:05.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If only my eyes could see, I would have \Nstared a hole through your manly face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:09.35,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.19,0:09:14.40,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Mirika! What's wrong with him?\N What's wrong with him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.33,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Brother Lyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:23.67,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:25.41,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:30.04,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I never knew that you could get flustered\N and blush like that, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:32.30,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,I-I'm not blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:34.84,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,You! You need to let me go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:37.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh! You're strong, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:39.45,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Okay! Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:41.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm glad you understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:48.60,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.32,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:05.70,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I will announce those \Nwho passed the final exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:22.97,main,KAST,0,0,0,,All of you passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:28.46,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,You did it, Prince Lyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.34,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:34.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you, and likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:37.11,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,We're graduating together, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:39.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:49.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I had a great time thanks to \NYour Highness and the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I hope our paths will cross again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.10,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,See you, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:59.09,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,He was a bit quirky, but a \Nbright, wonderful student.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:02.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you're looking for a boyfriend, \Nhow about my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then we'll see each \Nother again in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:06.93,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Kunon, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.42,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,I've said too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:13.19,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,And I've had my heart broken \Nby a graduate for no reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.03,0:11:16.78,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:19.58,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.21,main,HAINA,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.87,0:11:25.69,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,We'll come with you wherever you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:30.83,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Whirlpool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:33.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay. A-ori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:40.55,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Make a sudden stop and split it into ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:41.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.18,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Color them red, blue, and green!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:49.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:52.91,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Change the texture!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:53.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:11:59.73,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Very good. Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:01.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:05.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've made alterations by adding shape \Nand temperature to the texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:11.33,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:22.61,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:31.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:34.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If it's about the dinner \Nto celebrate graduation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:37.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,as a gentleman, I'd love a chance to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.01,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's not about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:45.97,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,but your graduation does give me a perfect \Nopportunity to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:47.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:52.09,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Are you mentally prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:55.54,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I'm going to reveal a shocking truth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:01.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:09.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.41,0:13:13.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is so sudden, I can't accept...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:17.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,that you're actually\Nthe goddess of the night sky
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:20.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and you must return to\N the world of gods soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.85,0:13:24.19,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Personally, I love that story, \Nbut that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:30.08,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,The truth is that there is \Nnothing I can teach you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:31.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:35.10,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I'll stop my poor pretense and come clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:39.69,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's actually been quite a while that \NI've had nothing else to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:43.93,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Elementary magic with no attacking ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:47.42,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I've taught everything I could in that range.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:52.93,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Now you're using magic better than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:59.20,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Once you learn new magic, \Nyou will surpass me in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:00.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.21,0:14:04.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I loved the little magic \Ntricks you've come up with,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:08.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,trying to deceive me with every possible method!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:12.86,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Oh, so you were aware that I was desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:15.00,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,That makes things easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:21.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes! Your tricks out of desperation \Ndefinitely broadened my range of magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:23.99,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's a water spell, "A-ori."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:27.16,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,You're producing water using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:31.26,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's about... the size of an eyeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:37.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Miss Jenié, you're the one \Nwho gave me a purpose in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:38.48,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:43.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And it was your little tricks that \Ntaught me the depths of magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:47.53,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,If you truly feel that way, \Nmaybe stop calling them "little tricks."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:51.36,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,And I had to rack my brain to squeeze them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:56.62,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,There were many times I \Nstruggled to come up with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:03.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:05.32,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.67,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Because I'm telling you it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:09.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is the problem your salary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:11.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Do you want to quit because the pay is low?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:14.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can ask Father to give you a raise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.41,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Actually, it's the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:20.44,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's unbearable to get paid so much \Nwhen I have no job to fulfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:24.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You were getting paid by drawing it out, \Nso why would you say something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:26.98,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I'm saying I've hit my limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:33.32,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:38.95,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,You should have an exceptional sorcerer \Nwho's much better than me as your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.78,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I can't help you improve any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.33,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I can't guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.49,0:15:50.15,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I've managed to make it work with \Nyour lessons, but it's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:57.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Even if they're little tricks,\N if you can think up so many of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:15:59.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,then it's a respectable talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:02.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Deceive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Deceive me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:07.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Deceive me more elegantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:14.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I want you as my teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Just make it work and deceive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:33.64,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I can't do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:39.50,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, your magic is far \Nmore advanced than mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:44.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No. I like your little tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:47.07,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,If you truly like them, stop calling them that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:48.14,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:49.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:55.57,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,An unmistakable genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:17:00.45,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,Maybe Master Kunon has what it takes \Nto become the Cerulean Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:06.96,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,Even Master Kunon, with god-given talents,\Nwent through endless trial and error
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.81,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,and challenged himself to overcome it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:12.61,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I can't lose to my pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.23,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's not too late for me either!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:24.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? Lady Flora resigned, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:27.62,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes. You've finished the curriculum and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:30.87,main,IKO,0,0,0,,officially graduated from the \Nschool for noble children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:32.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I didn't say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:36.61,main,IKO,0,0,0,,She said she wouldn't be able to hold \Nback tears to say goodbye in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:39.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay. Maybe I'll write a letter of thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:44.37,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure she would love \Nthat. While you're at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:48.36,main,IKO,0,0,0,,can you ask if there's a male servant \Nwho's between 18 and 25 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:52.35,main,IKO,0,0,0,,well-paid, tall, and \Ngood-looking in her manor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your groom-to-be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:54.76,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:56.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You'd leave me and get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:18:00.20,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It pains me to be parted \Nfrom you, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:02.26,main,IKO,0,0,0,,But I'd like to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:06.52,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Plus, you'll be perfectly\N fine on your own now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:10.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:15.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Miss Jenié left me, Lady Flora \Nleft me, and if you leave me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:21.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,There's an old wives' tale that a \Nbunny dies when it feels too lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.11,0:18:23.79,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:27.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I won't ask about a male servant \Nwho's between 18 and 25 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:31.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,well-paid, tall, and good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:41.93,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Is that what Miss Jenié said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:46.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. She told me to find an \Nexceptional sorcerer for my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:48.67,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,An exceptional sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Do you have someone in mind, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:55.69,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor at school that there's \Nan extraordinary Royal Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:58.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Royal Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:00.95,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:04.77,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Girls especially were making a \Nfuss about Zeo-someone or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:07.83,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Was it perhaps Master Zeonly Finroll?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.32,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:12.20,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Apparently he's a sorcerer \Nof immense power and beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:14.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then I'd like him to be my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.09,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I said hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:21.34,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,It's impossible to invite a Royal Sorcerer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:27.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It is? Even for you, who's favored by and \Ncollusively connected with His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:29.71,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Who's feeding you these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:32.35,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Is it Iko? It's her, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:40.51,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Royal Sorcerer also refers to \Na title within the royal court.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:44.22,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Other than His Majesty and those \Nunder his chain of chain of command,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:46.24,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,no one can give orders to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:48.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's quite strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.96,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,They rarely leave the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:54.19,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Outside of royalty, getting in \Ntouch with them is also restricted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:20:00.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So meeting him directly is difficult, \Nlet alone inviting him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:02.07,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:09.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then how about I accompany you \Nwhen you visit the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:10.68,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,BY SOME MEANS OR ANOTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.65,0:20:11.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,by some means or another,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:15.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and when I'm lost, the Royal Sorcerers\N who happen to be there helps me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.21,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,BY SOME MEANS OR ANOTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:19.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And by some means or another \NI become their apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.69,0:20:25.56,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,How can you present such a vague, \Nflawed plan so confidently?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:29.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It's an elaborate plan \Nwith a 90% success rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:31.43,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,The success rate is less than 10%,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:34.19,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,and you'd never use "by some means \Nor another" in an elaborate plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:36.21,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Definitely not twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:39.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I thought it was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.03,0:20:40.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:43.09,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,AWW
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:43.09,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:45.70,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Yes, Kunon is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.60,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,Mother indulges Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.61,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Listen, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:52.66,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Can't you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:55.10,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon's practically begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:21:01.93,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Fine! I will at least ask His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.93,0:21:04.61,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,And Father indulges Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:06.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:08.26,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Asking is all I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:09.77,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Don't get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:10.79,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:12.34,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:14.12,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'll make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:18.67,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Grand Master, I brought you the document.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.65,0:21:24.79,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,About that child?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:30.04,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,An apprentice-level sorcerer asking to \Nstudy under a Royal Sorcerer is unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:33.14,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Even for a noble close to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:37.45,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Power and status mean \Nnothing to Royal Sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:42.78,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,But my little sister Mirika is head \Nover heels for this tiny sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.43,0:21:44.14,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:49.02,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Oh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:50.49,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:54.19,main,LONDIMONDE,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN {top left},0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE: OFF TO THE CASTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:38.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "Off to the Castle."
